# node / wails frontend
node_modules/
# Pure build output. Note main.go does `//go:embed all:frontend/dist`, so bare
# `go build` on a fresh clone fails until the frontend has been built once -
# `wails build`/`wails dev` create the directory themselves, and CI runs vite
# before go. A committed placeholder cannot help here: vite empties outDir on
# every build and would delete it.
app/frontend/dist/
app/frontend/package.json.md5

